Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.43,Narration,,0,0,0,,GPS does not send a\Nfull calendar date.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:05.43,Narration,,0,0,0,,Older signals stored that\Nweek number in ten bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:08.23,Narration,,0,0,0,,The range ends at 1,023.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:10.63,Narration,,0,0,0,,At the limit, there\Nis no new number left.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.93,0:00:13.40,Narration,,0,0,0,,Zero is sent again when\Nthe next week begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.76,0:00:16.56,Narration,,0,0,0,,Old software read zero\Nas the previous cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.86,0:00:18.73,Narration,,0,0,0,,Their displayed date\Njumped backward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:20.86,Narration,,0,0,0,,Real time kept\Nmoving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:23.76,Narration,,0,0,0,,An update selected\Nthe correct GPS cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:26.20,Narration,,0,0,0,,Now the receiver shows\Nthe correct date.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.50,0:00:28.46,Narration,,0,0,0,,The number repeated.\NTime did not.
